<programme start="20261125190000 +0000" stop="20261125210000 +0000" channel="CBS Sports"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Acrisure Series: Arizona State vs. LSU</sub-title><desc lang="en">The No. 25 LSU Tigers (6-0) and the Arizona State Sun Devils (5-0) face off in the 2026 Acrisure Series at Acrisure Arena. Both teams enter this game with perfect records. Arizona State defeated Oakland 68-65, while LSU won to Queens 106-75.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
