<programme start="20261125160000 +0000" stop="20261125180000 +0000" channel="SN1"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Detroit Pistons at Orlando Magic</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Magic host the Pistons in NBA Cup Group Stage play at Kia Center. Both teams enter on losses, with Detroit at 10-6 and fifth in the East facing an Orlando side sitting eighth at 7-9.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
