<programme start="20261126003000 +0000" stop="20261126030000 +0000" channel="SN1"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Cleveland Cavaliers at New York Knicks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Knicks host the Cavaliers in NBA Eastern Conference play at Madison Square Garden. At 11-6 and winners of five straight, New York welcome a Cleveland side that handed them their last home loss, 115-107, just two weeks ago.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261126030000 +0000" stop="20261126053000 +0000" channel="SN1"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">San Antonio Spurs at Portland Trail Blazers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Trail Blazers host the Spurs in NBA Western Conference play at Moda Center. First in the West at 15-3, San Antonio have won nine of their last ten; Portland enter at 11-6 after a road win over Philadelphia.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
