<programme start="20261126060000 +0000" stop="20261126080000 +0000" channel="SN1"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Miami Heat at Philadelphia 76ers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The 76ers host the Heat in NBA play at Xfinity Mobile Arena. First in the Eastern Conference at 14-4, Philadelphia welcome a Miami side that has won seven straight and sits sixth in the East at 10-6.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
