<programme start="20261125220000 +0000" stop="20261126003000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Miami Heat at Philadelphia 76ers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The 76ers host the Heat in NBA play at Xfinity Mobile Arena. First in the Eastern Conference at 14-4, Philadelphia welcome a Miami side that has won seven straight and sits sixth in the East at 10-6.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261126003000 +0000" stop="20261126030000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Minnesota Timberwolves at Oklahoma City Thunder</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Thunder host the Timberwolves in NBA Western Conference play at Paycom Center. Oklahoma City sit tenth in the West at 10-8 after losing four of their last five, while Minnesota arrive third at 13-5 and winners of four of five.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261126030000 +0000" stop="20261126053000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NBA Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">San Antonio Spurs at Portland Trail Blazers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Trail Blazers host the Spurs in NBA Western Conference play at Moda Center. First in the West at 15-3, San Antonio have won nine of their last ten; Portland enter at 11-6 after a road win over Philadelphia.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191276_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
